{
  "slug": "windmill-hr",
  "name": "Windmill Hr",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude Code to Windmill for performance reviews, feedback, 1:1s, pulse surveys, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `collect-feedback` (Context and guidance for collecting user-initiated feedback about colleagues), `create-pulse` (Context and guidance for creating pulse surveys), `manage-1on1s` (Context and guidance for managing 1:1 meetings), `manage-notes` (Context and guidance for managing private notes for the current employee), `manage-pulse` (Context and guidance for managing existing pulses)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `windmill`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install windmill-hr@claude-community` from `windmill-dev/windmill-plugin` (`plugins/windmill`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
